This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Tektronix or Keithley
Instruments. "Keithley", "SourceMeter", "TSP" and "TSP-Link" are their
trademarks.

No Keithley source code, instrument library or manual content is
redistributed here. The TSP Toolkit extension and the 2450 command
libraries it ships are installed separately from Tektronix.

These scripts source real voltage and current into real devices. The
compliance limit set in a script is what protects the device under test; it
is not a safety interlock, and it cannot protect a device, an instrument or
a person from a wiring mistake or from a limit set for the wrong instrument.
